cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use data-aggregator-mcp in your work, please cite it as below."
title: data-aggregator-mcp
abstract: >-
  A unified research-data acquisition server for the Model Context Protocol
  (MCP). Exposes search and fetch over research data repositories (Zenodo,
  DataCite), NCBI omics archives (GEO, SRA, BioProject), and the literature
  (PubMed, OpenAIRE) behind a single normalized data model, so that language
  models and agents can discover and retrieve datasets across heterogeneous
  sources through one interface.
type: software
